OL,3,GGrampian
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FMainly cloudy with outbreaks of
OL,6,Frain in the morning, turning more
OL,7,Fshowery in the early afternoon, some
OL,8,Fof the showers may be on the heavy
OL,9,Fside. Becoming mostly dry from mid-
OL,10,Fafternoon with bright spells
OL,11,Fdeveloping.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FChance of the odd shower at
OL,14,Ffirst but otherwise it will stay dry
OL,15,Fthrough the evening and overnight with
OL,16,Fsome sunny then clear spells and
OL,17,Fturning quite chilly.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
